/* Cline.swift */
"Cline's hooks in VS Code follow its “Enable Hooks” switch (on by default). Cline has no permission-request hook, so approvals still happen in Cline. A task that errors in VS Code fires no hook, so its card ends only when stuck detection kicks in." = "Cline 在 VS Code 里的 hook 受「Enable Hooks」开关控制（默认开）。Cline 没有权限请求 hook，批准仍在 Cline 里做。VS Code 里任务出错不会触发 hook，卡片要等卡住检测才结束。";
/* DeepSeek.swift */
