"How long agents waited for you, away time taken out. Replying: from an agent asking a question or permission, or finishing a turn, to your answer or next prompt. Reviewing: from a turn finishing to you opening it or following up. Each figure is the average; on the arcs the lit band holds the middle half and each dot is one." = "Agent 等你多久，离开的时间不算。回复：从 Agent 提问、请求权限或跑完一轮，到你回答或发下一条。验收：从一轮跑完，到你打开它或接着发消息。数字是平均值；弧上亮的一段是中间一半，每个点是一次。";
"Hours of agent work per hour you were here. Agent time counts all running, away included; yours counts only while you were at the Mac and an agent was running or waiting on you. Each bar is one day's leverage, the pale one behind it the same day of the period before; above 1×, agents did more than you spent." = "你在场的每小时里，Agent 干了几小时的活。Agent 时间算上所有运行，包括你离开时；你的时间只算你在电脑前、且有 Agent 在运行或等你的时候。每根柱是一天的杠杆，后面的浅色柱是上一周期的同一天；高于 1× 即 Agent 干的比你花的多。";
"How many agents ran at the same time, on average while any ran, and at the peak. The dotted line is the period before; the gray strip under it is when you were at the Mac. In a month, each point is that day's agent hours." = "同一时间有几个 Agent 在跑：有 Agent 运行时的平均值，以及峰值。虚线是上一周期，下方灰条是你在电脑前的时段。月视图中每个点是当天的 Agent 总工时。";
"Each agent's share of the running time, with its turns. The line is when it ran across the period." = "每个 Agent 占总运行时间的比例和轮数。折线是它在这段时间里何时在运行。";
"Agent running time by project; a circle's area is its time. Under each name, how long its sessions waited on you." = "按项目统计的 Agent 运行时间，圆的面积代表时长。项目名下方是它的会话等你的时长。";
"The last 7 days in half hours, brighter where more agents ran at once. Each row ends with that day's agent hours; Busiest marks the 3 hours with the most agent time." = "最近 7 天，每格半小时，同时运行的 Agent 越多越亮。每行末尾是当天的 Agent 总工时；「最忙」是 Agent 时间最多的 3 小时。";
"While you were here, the share of agent time spent running rather than blocked on you (asking or stuck). A finished turn waiting for review counts as neither." = "你在场时，Agent 时间里真正在运行、而不是卡在等你（提问或卡住）的占比。跑完等你验收的不算在内。";
"The most agents running at the same time." = "同一时间运行的 Agent 最多有几个。";
"Tools the agents called in the turns that finished in the period." = "这段时间内完成的轮次里，Agent 调用工具的次数。";
"Tokens the agents reported using." = "Agent 报告的 Token 用量。";
